+# Request checklist and verification boundaries
+
+| Human requirement | Outcome and location | Verification and unresolved issue |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| Compare336/337 against326/636/637/639 | Predecessor385f959 remains unchanged and linked in README; bounded prior findings preserved | This new unit reuses its prior source/pin records; no fresh full reading or repeated download of those six controls claimed |
+| Follow up59B/346/642 after checking prior holdings | SOURCES scoped holdings audit; actual three indexed PDFs newly acquired; all17 physical pages visually read | Search was not global. Court copies are not authenticated native fax/email/intelligence counterparts |
+| Preserve source links and exact locators |13 FR pins; source URLs, page fragments, page/header/paragraph/production marks, hashes and actual access times | Report line locators refer to our prose only; no invented source-transcript lines |
+| Preserve conflicting accounts and values | Earlier possible-association reports, later planned-wrongdoing caution, formal EC fields, explicit draft warning, different dates/roles/marking/redactions all retained | No controlling account chosen, historical cause adjudicated, later information backdated or masked identity reconstructed |
+| Check contrary evidence and our assumptions | British-sharing authority retained with source protection; proposed further investigation retained; failed negation suspicion expressly corrected | Permission, routing, characterizations and conditional proposals do not prove delivery, truth or executed action |
+| Preserve failures and editorial history | COMPARISON-AND-FAILED-CHECKS; earlier whitespace-stop/checklist and held/new editorial-diff links; local versions/receipts retained | Failed source-reading check is an agent error, not a source discrepancy. No failed attempt described as a successful publication |
+| Leave missing inputs as TODOs and continue available work | DRAFT-T01–T06 retain verbatim preceding missing-input descriptions and add exact new counterparts/triggers | Referenced336report/page7, native French fax/interview/translation, final EC/attachment, exact reviewer copies/receipts and action/custody outcomes still missing |
+| Keep original work plan and ownership | Original18 five-track criteria remain open/partial; no other technical-owner report or shared register edited | Source reading/publication does not complete native-input, empirical or original operational-record acceptance criteria |
+| Preserve versions and provide actual text diff | TEXT-CHANGES is real Git addition diff against absent state of the new directory; EDITORIAL-REVISION compares preserved candidatev1 to v2 | README, sources, pins, TODOs and source-check bodies unchanged across candidatev1/v2. Candidatev3 labels inherited source-role/reading fields explicitly as prior records and clarifies current TODO prose; previous missing-input wording remains verbatim. Original source pages and predecessor reports unchanged |
+| Keep PDF/layout review separate |17 whole-page1800px visual readings plus two3400px whole-page clause reinspections;19 render hashes recorded | No OCR, hidden-layer extraction, redaction recovery, exhaustive pixel/character diff, independent analyst or translation certification |
+| Commit/push reviewed public material as AveLyra | Nine-file public research payload; exact frozen identities, staging and publication guards used | Actual commit/push/ref/every-file verification follows freeze and is recorded separately. Branch push is not a main merge |
+| Exclude lawsuit material and private correspondence | No raw PDF/rasters/OCR, identifying/contact/passport/signature data, reconstructed identities, lawsuit files, private correspondence/strategy or credentials in public payload | Main case authority, originals, preserved checkouts and unrelated staged work untouched; no mailbox/outreach/fee/request/filing/deletion/private push/force/merge |
+| Send pertinent result to Overview under standing human authority | Local handoff to verified existing Overview chat after publication | Tool delivery receipt is separate from adoption, integration or acceptance; private coordination text not public evidence |
+
+Mechanical checks: nine declared PDF entities matched hashes/bytes/page counts; nineteen render hashes matched; six preserved predecessor text-file hashes recorded. These are reference-integrity checks, not historical validation. No scientific replication or completed historical-action test was run.
+
+The higher-resolution reinspection found the word not in both59Bp4 and642p6. The initial opposite-reading suspicion was explicitly pending and is preserved as a failed agent reading check. No source text was changed to remove a discrepancy.
+
+Candidatev1 and candidatev2 are preserved. The combined EDITORIAL-REVISION contains the actual v1-to-v2 comparison-record changes and v2-to-v3 source-status/TODO/checklist edits. Current candidatev3 leaves README and source observations unchanged. The unexecuted build-script draft and corrected script/diff remain local; they are not evidence about historical events.
